ue":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"La 3ème semaine d'un cycle d'entraînement, c'est celle où les séances d'intensité sont les plus dures... et en même temps là où la fatigue est la plus importante... profite du footing pour écouter tes sensations et estimer ton niveau de fatigue. Si tu le sens vraiment haut, mets les bouchées doubles sur la récup en rentrant (voir ici pour approfondir le sujet : https://www.running-addict.fr/conseil-running/sentrainer-regresser-la-recuperation-fait-progresser/ )","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_3_Alternative1","description":"Séance de S60 (sans S60), en \"over/under\", où l'on va encadrer la vitesse cible. Elle est composée de **4 séries** de 5' avec 2' de repos entre chaque série. Chaque 5' est composée de **2' au S30 suivi par 3' au SweetSpot, enchainé sans repos**. ","displayName":"Séance S60 alternative : \"Big Five\"","coachAdvice":"Mettre des petites accélérations en course c'est la signature des coureurs Kenyans. Reproduire cette variation d'allure poncutellement à l'entrainement a pour avantage d'apprendre à maitriser différentes allures sans récupération et ainsi d'étendre notre zone de confort.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a675420ce2d2a7e261e393a","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1788134400000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":2,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velout