ervalles longs, mais qui te mettra vraiment en confiance. Tout ce que tu as réalisé avant ce cycle prendra son sens ici, c'est ici qu'on aligne toutes les planètes.","isStatic":false},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":596.890306860121,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":253.98827697491785,"dvalue":11.573523532426787,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":191.47786194190996,"dvalue":5.680325387285995,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":153.3066892856115,"dvalue":3.2450550495870787,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":326.9188445769923,"dvalue":20.04131636600129,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":298.97432705049135,"dvalue":16.637270113260726,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":267.39603642294827,"dvalue":13.023519503478507,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":317.22772476589734,"dvalue":18.840448217389056,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":253.98827697491785,"dvalue":11.573523532426787,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":241.25280876882604,"dvalue":10.248499750294213,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":211.21315900344075,"dvalue":7.357159086476626,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":288.2986333087969,"dvalue":14.208316879024885,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","value":262.21750465915585,"dvalue":12.457097359045111,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"10km","value":246.98436043826277,"dvalue":10.838219950000846,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"5km","value":233.63459641560135,"dvalue":9.482279732796188,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"1500m","value":212.13883397970798,"dvalue":7.440660429615214,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"endurance-confort","value":339.55077030231354,"dvalue":21.637353917392886,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","value":326.9188445769923,"dvalue":20.04131636600129,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-active","value":317.22772476589734,"dvalue":18.840448217389056,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vo2max","value":211.21315900344075,"dvalue":7.357159086476626,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"race","value":288,"dvalue":14.208316879024885,"abstract":false,"competitive":true,"race":{"distance":42.195,"elevation":0,"goalId":"6a675372ba63bbdf0c9d5e48"}}],"sessions":[{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 5 SEANCE 1","description":"Séance en 3 blocs. Les deux premiers blocs sont composés de 2 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Le renforcement est important pour la santé et pour la performance. Mais si tu veux conserver cette habitude longtemps, le mieux est qu'elle n'ait que peu d'impact sur le reste de tes entrainements. De ce fait, n'hésite pas à abaisser ton référentiel d'intensité sur le renforcement. Pour le dire autrement : \"à fond\" en renforcement, c'est moins \"à fond\" qu'en course à pied.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"moderate","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://w